    <string name="onboarding_1_title">Syria, from a distance</string>
    <string name="onboarding_1_body">Fortresses, rivers, museums, kitchens and workshops — the places that carry the country\'s history, gathered into one catalog.</string>

    <string name="onboarding_2_title">Every entry is vouched for</string>
    <string name="onboarding_2_body">Landmarks are written and reviewed before they are published, in Arabic and English, with the practical facts you need to actually go.</string>

